Adapted designs in the memory module (server/modules/memory)
-------------------------------------------------------------
The memory module is TeamBot's own code. A few of its designs were adapted (re-written in
TypeScript and Dutch, not copied) from these open-source projects:

- Hindsight (https://github.com/vectorize-io/hindsight), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2025 Vectorize AI, Inc. The consolidation step on write (consolidate.ts:
  comparing a new fact with the memories it touches and deciding whether it repeats, changes
  or ends one) follows the structure of Hindsight's consolidation prompt and consolidator, and
  the dossier reread (reread.ts) its delta retain. Its permission notice:

