- Mem0 (https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0), Apache License 2.0. The learner's extraction
  guidance (learn.ts: also everyday and incidental facts; doubt about worth keeps a fact,
  doubt about truth drops it) and the update step on write (add / update / no change).

- Graphiti (https://github.com/getzep/graphiti), Apache License 2.0. Validity in time:
  a fact that no longer holds gets an end date and a reason instead of being deleted, only
  what holds now is used for "now", and the history stays searchable; and from its edge
  resolution prompt the rule that a new fact about the same subject does not by itself end
  a role or a habit.

- Cognee (https://github.com/topoteretes/cognee), Apache License 2.0. The idea of comparing
  a new version of a document chunk by chunk, so only what changed is read again.

The built-in embedding model, IBM granite-embedding-97m-multilingual-r2
(https://huggingface.co/ibm-granite/granite-embedding-97m-multilingual-r2), is licensed
